flowchart LR
    accTitle: Three model roles with application-controlled tools
    accDescr: The application routes instruction following and writing to Grok 4.3, reasoning and tool selection to Grok 4.20, and analysis of collected evidence to Grok 4.20 Multi-Agent. Python validates tool requests before execution. Multi-Agent receives evidence, without direct access to connectors.
    routing["Task router"] --> instruction["Grok 4.3<br/>Understand + write"]
    routing --> reason["Grok 4.20<br/>Reason + review"]
    routing --> research["4.20 Multi-Agent<br/>Analyze evidence"]
    reason -->|Tool request| tools["Python checks + runs tools"]
    tools -. Results .-> reason
    tools -. Collected evidence .-> research
    classDef model fill:#edf3fc,stroke:#8da6c7,color:#243b58;
    classDef tools fill:#fff6e6,stroke:#caa65d,color:#5b451b;
    class instruction,reason,research model;
    class tools tools;
